  "description": "*“Facing the truth only distances you from vengeance. And the stronger your opponent, the further you have to remove yourself from the truth.”*\n\nCastle. The criminal organization that gathers in the Castle Hotel in Gangnam. Eight years ago, they killed Shin Kim’s father. Then they killed his mentor. Now, he wants revenge-- and he knows just the people he’ll need to get the job done.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
